1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,550
Day one.
I did everything right.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:06,615
I nailed boards over the front door and told
myself they would hold.

3
00:00:06,615 --> 00:00:08,345
Then I looked through the window.

4
00:00:08,345 --> 00:00:09,760
There were so many of them.

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,388
Day two, they were still there.

6
00:00:12,388 --> 00:00:14,929
Day three... they still hadn't moved.

7
00:00:14,929 --> 00:00:16,371
So I got comfortable.

8
00:00:16,371 --> 00:00:19,117
I stopped sleeping behind the barricade.

9
00:00:19,117 --> 00:00:20,490
That was my mistake.

10
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,849
Because they weren't trying to get in.

11
00:00:22,849 --> 00:00:26,420
They were looking at me the way you look at
someone who doesn't know yet.

12
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:31,137
Then one of them pressed its hand against
the glass... and pointed up.

13
00:00:31,137 --> 00:00:34,270
I had been sleeping under that hatch for
three days.

14
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:38,008
So I did the only thing left.
I opened the door.

15
00:00:38,008 --> 00:00:39,560
And they stepped aside.
